{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "backend-performance",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-23T10:25:32.693819077Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-23T15:44:45.518676687Z",
    "version": 1,
    "project": "xpu-monitoring"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "后端请求性能",
      "description": "统一核心图表；来源特有指标列于专属诊断。单位见标题，统计差异见图表提示。"
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "ListVariable",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "角色",
            "hidden": false
          },
          "defaultValue": ".*",
          "allowAllValue": false,
          "allowMultiple": false,
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "StaticListVariable",
            "spec": {
              "values": [
                {
                  "label": "全部",
                  "value": ".*"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Prefill",
                  "value": "(prefill|xpu-2)"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Decode",
                  "value": "(decode|xpu-1)"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "name": "role"
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "core-e2e": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "端到端延迟 E2E（秒）",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧请求从开始到结束的总时延。不同输入/输出长度、缓存状态和并发负载会改变分布；不能把不同阶段的 P95 相减来求网关开销。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\nXPU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n请求派生口径\n后端指标使用原生统计，不强制区分流式。正常业务以流式为主；精度测试期间可能混入非流式并影响延迟分布。XPU ITL 按输出批次平均。新口径上线前的历史留空，不做迁移。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "sort_by_label((label_replace((label_replace((label_replace(((monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.(p50|p95|p99)\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.(p50|p95|p99)\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.(p50|p95|p99)\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.(p50|p95|p99)\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.(p50|p95|p99)\"}) < 15)) * 1), \"perses_order\", \"00\", \"path\", \".*[.]p50\")), \"perses_order\", \"01\", \"path\", \".*[.]p95\")), \"perses_order\", \"02\", \"path\", \".*[.]p99\")), \"perses_order\", \"path\")",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "core-itl": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Token 间延迟 ITL（ms）",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧相邻输出 Token 间隔的时延分布。它不是整个回答的生成时间；与按整段输出均摊的 TPOT 也可能不同。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\nXPU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n请求派生口径\n后端指标使用原生统计，不强制区分流式。正常业务以流式为主；精度测试期间可能混入非流式并影响延迟分布。XPU ITL 按输出批次平均。新口径上线前的历史留空，不做迁移。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "sort_by_label((label_replace((label_replace((label_replace((((monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.(p50|p95|p99)\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.(p50|p95|p99)\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.(p50|p95|p99)\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.(p50|p95|p99)\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.(p50|p95|p99)\"}) < 15)) * 1) * 1000.0), \"perses_order\", \"00\", \"path\", \".*[.]p50\")), \"perses_order\", \"01\", \"path\", \".*[.]p95\")), \"perses_order\", \"02\", \"path\", \".*[.]p99\")), \"perses_order\", \"path\")",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "core-output": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "后端输出 Token 吞吐（Token/秒）",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧 Token 计数在连续采集间隔内的平均增长速率，按节点/角色展示。Token 是分词器单位，不等同于字符数或请求数；不同模型或输入输出组成的吞吐不宜直接比较。输出 Token 与 Decode Token 遵循各自源指标，源无效时留空。\n\nXPU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n请求派生口径\n后端指标使用原生统计，不强制区分流式。正常业务以流式为主；精度测试期间可能混入非流式并影响延迟分布。XPU ITL 按输出批次平均。新口径上线前的历史留空，不做迁移。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              },
              "visual": {
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "min": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "minStep": "5s",
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"xpu-pd\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.output_tokens\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "core-requests": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "后端请求速率（请求/秒）",
            "description": "指标含义\n源服务请求累计计数（sglang:num_requests_total）在连续采样间隔内的平均增长速率。按节点/角色展示；不等于成功请求吞吐，也不等于网关到达速率。同一请求可能经过 P/D 两侧，不能把两侧直接相加当作去重请求量。\n\nXPU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。\n\n请求派生口径\n后端指标使用原生统计，不强制区分流式。正常业务以流式为主；精度测试期间可能混入非流式并影响延迟分布。XPU ITL 按输出批次平均。新口径上线前的历史留空，不做迁移。"
